## School Store Policy

### Included with the School ERP

* Up to 20 products are included with the initial ERP setup.
* 10 product updates are included free during the **first month** of support.

### After the Free Support Period

The following service charges will apply:

* ₹299** – Add **1 new product**
* ₹150** – Edit an existing product (including changing product details, price, image, or replacing product information)
* ₹150** – Delete an existing product

> These charges cover the content management service and ensure your School Store remains accurate, secure, and professionally maintained.
